recursive-include skills/tdd-feature *.md
recursive-include skills/code-review *.md
recursive-include skills/ui-polish *.md
recursive-include skills/debug *.md
recursive-include skills/security-check *.md
include docs/getting-started.md docs/architecture.md docs/financial-semantics.md
include docs/api.md docs/evaluation.md docs/paypal-setup.md docs/roadmap.md
include agent.py docs/agents.md
include draft_plan.py
